#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Why do I see a message that my account is inactive when I try to log on? "
"{#why-do-i-see-a-message-that-my-account-is-inactive-when-i-try-to-log-on}"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi un message m'indique que mon compte est inactif lorsque j'essaie de"
" me connecter ? {#why-do-i-see-a-message-that-my-account-is-inactive-when-i-"
"try-to-log-on}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you see the message \"This account is inactive\", visit the [IBM Cloud "
"documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) to learn why and how to fix it, or access [IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) to verify whether you have any pending actions"
" to complete in your account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si tu vois le message « This account is inactive », consulte la "
"[documentation IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) pour en savoir plus sur les causes possibles et comment y"
" remédier, ou accède à [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) pour vérifier si "
"des actions en attente sont à effectuer dans ton compte.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What is the impact of device drift? {#what-is-the-impact-of-device-drift}"
msgstr ""
"Quel est l'impact de la dérive des appareils ? {#what-is-the-impact-of-"
"device-drift}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The impact of device drift (hardware performance that degrades over time) "
"depends on many factors, such as when calibrations were last run, the "
"specific experiment performed, any TLS activities, and so on. If a "
"particular workload is very sensitive to device parameters' error values, "
"you can perform a real-time device parameter benchmarking by following [this"
" tutorial](/tutorials/real-time-benchmarking-for-qubit-selection) in IBM "
"Quantum Learning.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'impact de la dérive des appareils (dégradation des performances "
"matérielles au fil du temps) dépend de nombreux facteurs, tels que la date "
"des dernières calibrations, l'expérience spécifique effectuée, les activités"
" TLS, etc. Si un workload particulier est très sensible aux valeurs d'erreur"
" des paramètres de l'appareil, tu peux effectuer une analyse comparative en "
"temps réel des paramètres de l'appareil en suivant [ce "
"tutoriel](/tutorials/real-time-benchmarking-for-qubit-selection) dans IBM "
"Quantum Learning.\n"
